1153
02:42:18,460 --> 02:42:27,580
Court Administrator Theresa Dolores Gomez-Estoesta: Thank you po, Your Honor. Kapag po nag-grant, an injunction is usually a prayer, an ancillary remedy.

1154
02:42:27,940 --> 02:42:35,040
Court Administrator Theresa Dolores Gomez-Estoesta: So provisional remedy siya to a main action. So kung yung action na yun, after hearing, ay gagrant na ng court.

1155
02:42:35,040 --> 02:42:37,040
Court Administrator Theresa Dolores Gomez-Estoesta: To answer for the damages that may...

1156
02:42:38,000 --> 02:42:50,000
Court Administrator Theresa Dolores Gomez-Estoesta: That the other, the adverse party will have, kailangan po talaga mag-post ng bond itong movant.

1157
02:42:50,620 --> 02:42:59,660
Court Administrator Theresa Dolores Gomez-Estoesta: And that will answer for, as I've said, the damages in the event that the injunction is already, the writ of injunction is already implemented.

