Court Administrator Theresa Dolores Gomez-Estoesta: Hindi po siya ma-i-implement, hindi po siya ma-i-issue ng court.

1164
02:43:25,320 --> 02:43:32,300
Court Administrator Theresa Dolores Gomez-Estoesta: Kasi po, kailangan po talaga yung bond is a prerequisite before the writ of injunction or preliminary injunction will issue.

1165
