Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Thank you po. So ibig sabihin po, if there is no bond, then there is no injunction.

1166
02:43:37,540 --> 02:43:37,980
Court Administrator Theresa Dolores Gomez-Estoesta: Yes po.

