1176
02:44:26,980 --> 02:44:30,260
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: So ano po ang proseso dito, ma'am?

1177
02:44:32,550 --> 02:44:33,870
Court Administrator Theresa Dolores Gomez-Estoesta: Ano po, marami.

1178
02:44:34,150 --> 02:44:39,010
Court Administrator Theresa Dolores Gomez-Estoesta: Ang pagkakaalam po, ang isang judge dapat po, dapat well-versed sa batas.

1179
02:44:39,010 --> 02:44:47,230
Court Administrator Theresa Dolores Gomez-Estoesta: Ang judge po, dapat alam din if they are exercising jurisdiction over a subject matter, over the person of an accused.

1180
02:44:47,610 --> 02:44:52,890
Court Administrator Theresa Dolores Gomez-Estoesta: So kasi po talagang territorial tayo kung criminal cases or subject matter sa civil cases.

1181
02:44:53,450 --> 02:44:59,970
Court Administrator Theresa Dolores Gomez-Estoesta: Kung wala pong jurisdiction at yung judge ay biglang nagsabi sa kanyang decision or order ay may jurisdiction siya.

1182
