1189
02:46:32,480 --> 02:46:44,380
Rep. Jan "Atty. JP" Padiernos: Kaya dapat sapat ang pondo para mapunan ang vacancies, mabawasan ang backlog, mapabilis ang proceedings, at maging accessible ang courts nationwide.

1190
02:46:44,820 --> 02:46:45,480
Rep. Jan "Atty. JP" Padiernos: Our support,

1191
02:46:45,640 --> 02:47:10,280
Rep. Jan "Atty. JP" Padiernos: however, is not blank check. A larger budget must produce measurable results, fewer delayed cases, shorter waiting times, stronger digital systems, and greater transparency. Judicial independence and fiscal accountability must go together. Subject to these commitments, I respectfully support the proposed budget of the judiciary. Maraming salamat po at magandang hapon.

1192
02:47:10,500 --> 02:47:12,060
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: Maraming salamat din po, Your Honor.

